# The API image needs `pyproject.toml`, `uv.lock`, `alembic.ini` and `bacatlas_backend/` — nothing
# else. ⚠ A local `.venv` copied in would be a macOS venv inside a Linux image: it imports nothing,
# and it would shadow the one the Dockerfile builds.
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
tests
scripts
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
